{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50022","headline":"句 · 何元","name":"句","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一望白云千万断，筝声日暮出花林。\n门外夕阳寒映竹，洞中秋水暗连山。\n钟声半夜香山雨，散入前林枫叶秋。\n寺临飞鸟青山远，径转幽萝白日长。\n黄昏人到钟声里，云起龙池不见山。\n客来惆怅僧禅後，月出松门满地霜。\n朔风寒日笳声急，万里辽城一段云。\n满山月色连溪下，林叶萧萧一夜霜。\n秦客访花惊出洞，庾公看月误登楼。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"何元","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50022.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50022","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}